WEBVTT

00:17:57.076 --> 00:18:00.566
in creating a way out of no way.

00:18:00.590 --> 00:18:03.928
BS: Do you think there are strategies
that we've abandoned

00:18:03.952 --> 00:18:06.356
that we need to pick back up

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:08.870
to confront the issues
that we're looking at today?

00:18:08.894 --> 00:18:12.841
JL: I think there's so many tactics

00:18:12.865 --> 00:18:14.917
and techniques

00:18:14.941 --> 00:18:18.574
that we've sort of abandoned

00:18:18.598 --> 00:18:20.904
that we need to go back

00:18:20.928 --> 00:18:24.535
and pick up these techniques and tactics

00:18:24.559 --> 00:18:25.799
and use them.

00:18:25.823 --> 00:18:27.679
We need to teach people,

00:18:27.703 --> 00:18:30.008
especially our young people.